  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to quality reproductive health care is strengthened, with a focus on sexual and reproductive health and the fight against gender-based violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the implementation of the national health sector policy and health strategy, and the current and future sub-sector strategies, in particular on MNCH (Maternal, Newborn and Child Health), Family Planning-ASRH (Adolescent Sexual and Reproductive Health), NCD (Non-Communicable Diseases) including Mental Health and Nutrition. The alignment to national strategies will strengthen the sustainability of this support.</narrative>
